msgstr "KDE 2"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:208
msgid "&Configure [%1]"
msgstr "&Çawdêrîkirin [%1]"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:458
msgid ""
"<h1>Window Decorations</h1>This module allows you to choose the window "
"border decorations, as well as titlebar button positions and custom "
"decoration options."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Dîkora birêvebirê penceran</h1>Ev Modul desttûr dide te ku tu "
"Dîkorê pirwazên penceran û cihê penceran û dugmeyên lista Tîtel û "
"hinek dananê din sazbike."

